{"channelId":"UCG8L_0j6p5wf_nB9cBapKMQ","row":["Freely Forward Bodywork",143678,"Hi there! I'm Maija, the founder of Freely Forward Bodywork. As an equine massage therapist, my focus is on enabling your horses’ comfort and performance through the use of massage therapy and stretching techniques. I aim to work with you and enable your horse to perform to its full potential, by analysing and assessing posture, movement, and skeletal function.\n\nFrom providing a range of services to forming a treatment plan that is an integral part of my approach to treating the whole body, to offering online courses where you can learn effective techniques on how to treat your horse yourself, Freely Forward Bodywork is your go-to hub for equine wellness and performance.\n\nCheck out our brand new podcast, NO BUCKS GIVEN, where we have honest conversations about the horse industry with industry professionals about the hard truths around what matters most, how to best advocate for our horses. Subscribe here or anywhere you get podcasts!","allie@freelyforwardbodywork.com; maija@freelyforwardbodywork.com; Pam@freelyforwardbodywork.com",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG8L_0j6p5wf_nB9cBapKMQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG8L_0j6p5wf_nB9cBapKMQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:01:40.173Z","channelId":"UCG8L_0j6p5wf_nB9cBapKMQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"88a050531877339ddb271705e3f647a49201c209feef4d1b563363bc090b0e96","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"512e9fdf0feab0a651db0ded3a60eb2e92cf979a54691918cf20c3507f64a691"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/freelyforwardbodywork","identityStatus":"cross_linked","value":69672,"raw":"69,672","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/freelyforwardbodywork/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:14:39.104Z"},{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/freelyforwardbodywork","identityStatus":"cr